Debug mode on a directory skips files its `.gitignore` ignores, dot directories, and `node_modules`, so only `a.md` prints. `input/.git/HEAD` makes `input` a git repository: outln applies `.gitignore` files only inside one.
== args
--debug
input
== file input/.git/HEAD
ref: refs/heads/main
== file input/.gitignore
ignored.md
== file input/a.md
# a
== file input/ignored.md
# ignored
== file input/.hidden/h.md
# h
== file input/node_modules/dep/index.md
# dep
== stdout
\x1b[32m# a\x1b[0m
== stderr
== exit 0
